      "mergedPostDetails": "1. Get a VRC+ account, and add a sticker to your account\n\n2. Go to any world that has object buttons or other interactions with the Interact event registered in udon, or a pickup\n\n3. Try to place a sticker on it\n\nThis will trigger the interact or pickup as you place the sticker down, which feels unintentional.\n\nIn the case of the pickup, the sticker will be placed on the surface under it.\n\nThis is tested on PC, untested in VR.",
